{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:50dd78683e09f165","name":"Jal Shey Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-50dd78683e09f165","title":"Jal Shey Talent Tree","revision":19184,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:28:49Z","sha256":"47572239b604b4cbbe5fb53bebefd19c32c3af9bb3e278568dae92841a34beb4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19184","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jal%20Shey%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-50dd78683e09f165","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Jal Shey"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jal_Shey","referenceId":"reference:f5450be28191b38e"}," concentrate on studying ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", improving their diplomacy, and applying their teachings to their trappings. Only Force-users that are part of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jal Shey"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jal_Shey","referenceId":"reference:f5450be28191b38e"}," may select ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," from this tree. \n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Action Exchange"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Delay"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever you successfully use ",{"tag":"b","children":["Force Delay"]},", you can grant one ally within 6 squares, and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," the ability to trade a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," for another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," on their next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Force Delay"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Jal Shey verbally startle opponents with a little help from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Once per encounter, you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of a target with an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," score of 3 or higher, that can understand you, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},". If successful, the target loses its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," on its next turn. If you choose to spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"},", the target instead loses its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Imbue Item"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to imbue a specifically crafted weapon, armor, or article of clothing with the power of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},". Imbuing the item requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},". As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", the wearer of such an item can open themselves to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", transferring one of their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"}," into the item. You can then use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," to spend a stored ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," at any later time, even in the same round that you spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," of your own.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can attune only one item per 24 hours, the item functions only for you, and a given item can only store one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," at a time. You cannot wear more than one attuned item at a time, and you can spend only up to a maximum of two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"}," in a round (one of your own, plus one from an ",{"tag":"b","children":["Imbued Item"]},").\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Knowledge of the Force"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You can use your scholarly knowledge of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"}," to help others reach their full potential. You can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," ally within 6 squares on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check, following the normal rules for the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action as usual.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
